w40k-cd-alert-stomach-impulse-active-name = Furnace Impulse
w40k-cd-alert-stomach-impulse-active-desc = Your metabolic surge is active. Movement speed is increased by 10% for 1 minute.
w40k-cd-alert-stomach-impulse-cooldown-name = Furnace Impulse Cooldown
w40k-cd-alert-stomach-impulse-cooldown-desc = The metabolic surge is recovering. Eating will not trigger the buff again until the cooldown ends.

w40k-cd-alert-kidney-purge-ready-name = Kidney Purge Ready
w40k-cd-alert-kidney-purge-ready-desc = Click to flush up to 5u of reagents from the Toxins group from your bloodstream.
w40k-cd-alert-kidney-purge-cooldown-name = Kidney Purge Cooldown
w40k-cd-alert-kidney-purge-cooldown-desc = The filtration burst is recovering. The purge will become available again when the cooldown ends.

w40k-cd-alert-war-furnace-ready-name = War Furnace Ready
w40k-cd-alert-war-furnace-ready-desc = Click to start War Furnace. For 5 seconds you recover 2.5 damage each second.
w40k-cd-alert-war-furnace-active-name = War Furnace Active
w40k-cd-alert-war-furnace-active-desc = War Furnace is running. You are regenerating 2.5 damage each second until the effect ends.
w40k-cd-alert-war-furnace-cooldown-name = War Furnace Cooldown
w40k-cd-alert-war-furnace-cooldown-desc = The furnace is cooling down. The ability will become available again when the cooldown ends.
